      "BAGEL CHIPS INGREDIENTS: ENRICHED FLOUR WHEAT FLOUR, MALTED BARLEY FLOUR, NACIN, REDUCED IRON, THIAMINE MONONITRATE\nRIBOFLAVIN, POLIC ACIDI, WATER. BROWN SUGAR, VEGETABLE OIL BLEND PALM GIL, CANOLA GIL, OLIVE OILY CONTANS LESS THAN 2% OI\nEACH OF THE FOLLOWING: SEA SALT, SOYBEAN OIL, SEMOLINA, SALT, YEAST, NATURAL FLAVOR, SUNFLOWER LECITHIN, LACTIC ACID\nANNATTO EXTRACT COLOR,\nSALAMI SLICE INGREDIENTS:\nLINARS, LACTIC ACID STARTER. CULTURE, SPICES, GARLIC POWDER\nSODIUM ASCORBATE, SODIUM NITRITE\nCHEESE SPREAD INGREDIENTS:\nCHEDDAR CHEESE (MILK, CHEESE CULTURES, SALT, ENZYMES)\nVATER, CREAM, MILK, WHEY, SODIUM PHOSPHATE, NATURAL CHEDDAR CHEESE FLAVOR, CHEESE CULTURES, SALT, ENZYMES, CALCIÚT\nPROPIONATE (PRESERVATIVE), GUAR AND XANTHAN GUMS.\nROASTED CHICKPEA INGREDIENTS:\nROASTED CHICKPEAS, SAFFLOWER OIL, SEA\nSALT, TOCOPHEROLS. FRUIT SNACK INGREDIENTS:\nORGANIC RICE SYRUP, ORGANIC CANE SUGAR, FRUIT PECTIN, CITRIC ACID, ASCORBIC\nACID, NATURAL FLAVORS (ORGANIC CARROT JUICE FROM CONCENTRATE, ORGANIC PUMPKIN JUICE FROM CONCENTRATE, ORGANIC APPLE\nJUICE FROM CONCENTRATE, ORGANIC BLACK-CURRANT JUICE FROM CONCENTRATE) FOR COLOR\nALLERGENS: BAGEL CHIPS CONTAIN WHEAT, SOY (OIL).\nCHEESE SPREAD CONTAINS MILK\nDISTRIBUTED BY OAKFIELD FARMS SOLUTIONS, LLC, GRAPEVINE, TEXAS 76051\nx5163\nBEST BY 06/27/18"
